{
  "dom_id": "step-e1067",
  "name": "Example: Converting a Radical to a Negative Fractional Exponent",
  "problem": "Express $\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt[3\\phantom{|}]{2y}}$ using power notation.",
  "worked_solution": "First, we convert the radical to a fractional exponent:\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt[3\\phantom{|}]{2y}} = \\dfrac{1}{(2y)^{1/3}}\n$$\n\n \n\nThen, we take the reciprocal and convert the exponent to a negative exponent:\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{1}{(2y)^{1/3}} = (2y)^{-1/3}\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore, we have:\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt[3\\phantom{|}]{2y}} = (2y)^{-1/3}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-e1067\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block;\">\n    \n                 \n                <div class=\"example\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">Example:</span> Converting a Radical to a Negative Fractional Exponent</div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"e1067\">?</div>\n                    </div>\n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                        <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\n          